   barColor). The engine reads these via window.{% endraw %}{{ row.capitalized }}{% raw %}.setChampions(),
   converting `hue` (hex) to its internal [r,g,b]. Nothing is hardcoded in
   the UI or the engine anymore; everything flows from this table. */
const CHAMPIONS = [
