   touch the raw client. Drop-in shaped like community supabase-react
   helpers — swap the underlying createClient import for the real SDK
   and every hook keeps working.

   Exports
     SupabaseProvider          owns the client + auth session
     useSupabase()             → the raw client (escape hatch)
     useAuth()                 → { user, session, loading, signIn, signUp,
                                    signInWithOAuth, signInWithOtp, signOut, updateUser }
     useProfile()              → { profile, loading, update } for the signed-in user
     useQuery(table, build, deps)  → { data, error, loading, refetch }
     useRealtimeQuery(table, build, deps)  → live-updating useQuery
     useRpc()                  → callable rpc(fn, args)
     useEdgeFunction()         → callable invoke(name, body)
     usePresence(topic, state) → { others, count }
